## ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
## AutoCreator AI — Module 1 (Organizations) REST collection, 29 routes
## Open in: VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP Client / Postman (import).
##
## Setup (one time):
##   1. pnpm dev:bootstrap && pnpm build && pnpm dev:api     (server on :3000)
##   2. eval "$(pnpm --silent dev:token -- --export)"        (ACA_TOKEN, ACA_ORG_ID)
##   3. fill @token + @orgId below (or create a fresh org in §1 and use its id)
##
## Conventions (docs/API.md §1): bearer session JWT · Idempotency-Key on
## mutations · RFC 9457 problem bodies · RateLimit-* response headers.
## ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@host = http://localhost:3000
@token = PASTE_ACA_TOKEN_HERE
@orgId = PASTE_ACA_ORG_ID_HERE
@departmentId = PASTE_AFTER_STEP_4
@teamId = PASTE_AFTER_STEP_5
@domainId = PASTE_AFTER_STEP_8

### 0. Platform (public, no auth) ─────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{host}}/health

###
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Swagger UI is served interactively at {{host}}/docs — spec:
GET {{host}}/openapi.json

###
GET {{host}}/metrics

### 1. Organizations ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Auth proof (401 problem without token):
GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}

###
POST {{host}}/v1/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "name": "My Media House", "slug": "my-media-house" }

### ↑ repeat this exact request (same Idempotency-Key) → 201 byte-identical
### replay with `Idempotency-Replayed: true`.

###
GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "name": "My Media House Group" }

### 2. Settings + security policy ─────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "timezone": "Asia/Riyadh", "defaultLocale": "ar-SA" }

###
PATCH {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/settings/security-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "enforceMfa": true, "sessionMaxHours": 12 }

### 3. Departments ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "name": "Content Production" }

### ← copy `id` from the response into @departmentId above.

###
GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "description": "All video-producing teams" }

### 4. Teams + members ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "name": "Shorts Squad", "departmentId": "{{departmentId}}" }

### ← copy `id` into @teamId above. (unknown departmentId → 404, in-transaction
###   tenant-scoped reference check.)

###
GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/teams/{{teamId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/teams/{{teamId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "name": "Shorts & Reels Squad" }

###
POST {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/teams/{{teamId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "userId": "PASTE_USER_ID (run pnpm dev:token — prints ACA_USER_ID)" }

###
DELETE {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/teams/{{teamId}}/members/PASTE_USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

###
DELETE {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/teams/{{teamId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

### 5. Branding + public resolve ──────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/brand
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Non-gated fields work on any plan. whiteLabel (hidePoweredBy: true) is a
### plan feature — the seeded plans keep it business/enterprise-only, so on
### demo-org (pro) requesting it honestly answers 403 FLAG_LOCKED (working
### entitlement enforcement; try both bodies):
PUT {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/brand
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "brandName": "Noor Podcasts", "primaryColor": "#1a7a4a" }

###
#PUT {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/brand
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
#Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
#content-type: application/json
#
#{ "brandName": "Noor Podcasts", "primaryColor": "#1a7a4a", "hidePoweredBy": true }

###
POST {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/brand/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

### Public white-label resolution (no auth; 404 unless the host is an ACTIVE
### verified custom domain):
GET {{host}}/v1/branding/resolve?host=portal.example

### 6. Custom domains (real DNS TXT verification) ──────────────────────────────

POST {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/domains
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "domain": "portal.example.com", "type": "PORTAL" }

### ← copy `id` into @domainId. Verification does a REAL TXT lookup:
### expected 409 + FAILED persisted until you publish the shown token.

###
POST {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/domains/{{domainId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

###
GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/domains
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/domains/{{domainId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

### 7. Billing profile + subscription ─────────────────────────────────────────

PUT {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/billing-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
content-type: application/json

{ "legalName": "Noor Media Holding LLC", "billingEmail": "billing@noor.example", "countryCode": "SA" }

###
GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/billing-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A subscription row exists only after a plan grant (billing module seeds it;
### demo-org comes with pro). On an org without a plan this honestly 404s.
GET {{host}}/v1/organizations/{{orgId}}/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
